menu "Codex Micro"

config CODEX_MICRO_USB_HID
    bool "Enable Codex Micro USB HID transport"
    default n
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    help
        Use the native USB OTG port for Codex RPC. The internal USB PHY can
        no longer serve USB Serial/JTAG while this app runs. Build with the
        dedicated sdkconfig.usb.defaults fragment and verify physical download
        mode recovery before deploying this image.

endmenu
